        <div class="pillars-grid">
            <div class="pillar">
                <span class="pillar-number">01</span>
                <h3>Accurate Billing</h3>
                <p>Every claim deserves a careful, line-by-line review. We verify codes, charges, and EOBs so errors like duplicate billing, upcoding, and services never rendered are caught and corrected.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="pillar">
                <span class="pillar-number">02</span>
                <h3>Real Recovery</h3>
                <p>Finding an error is only the start. We handle the paperwork, disputes, and appeals needed to get money back to patients and lost revenue back to medical practices.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="pillar">
                <span class="pillar-number">03</span>
                <h3>Healthier Outcomes</h3>
                <p>When billing is right, patients can focus on getting well and providers can focus on care. Less financial stress is part of a healthier outcome.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

